      "uid": "zhcn:270bbedfdb9bb3e57e1a291e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『女王杯』的疲劳没能完全恢复的可能性。\n加上初次海外远征的风险。\n可能带来的，最坏的结果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee5260b7259ac75e1668f672681d8c13b410938242055d048a29d2d38a9e3a2a",
