      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到大家心怀梦想的样子，\n直到最后一刻，\n我也依然犹豫不决……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f88eebbd3b79a3f1b2b78b439c0e060ffa774068fbb9cfe853565d2e0f0f8",
